  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the turbulent flow sea area, a huge current of light yellow water blocks Fang Yuan’s path, and he names it yellow spring water. Yellow spring water comes from the yellow spring sea area, the territory of Zombie Alliance’s headquarters and the largest zombie farming area in the five regions, filled with zombie corpses, decomposed coral, and drifting seaweed.",
