        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yellow spring water contains dao marks and is a type of Gu refinement material. The current Fang Yuan meets flows in one direction that is not the route he wants, so he charges through it with Immortal Gu and immortal essence until he reaches another current.",
